flowchart LR
    Client["Client (Web/Edge)"] -->|SDP Offer| CallGW["Call Gateway"] --> CallCtrl["Call Controller"]
    CallCtrl -->|negotiate| WebRTC["WebRTC Service"] -->|SDP Answer| Client
    Client ==>|RTP Audio Frames| WebRTC -->|audio.stream| STT["STT Service"] -->|STT API stream| STTAPI[(Whisper/Azure STT)]
    STTAPI -->|transcript.partial/final\n{text, timestamps}| STT --> CallCtrl
    CallCtrl -->|llm.request\n{text, sessionCtx}| LLM["LLM Service"] --> CallCtrl
    CallCtrl -->|tts.request\n{replyText, voice}| TTS["TTS Service"] -->|API| TTSAPI[(ElevenLabs/Azure TTS)]
    TTSAPI -->|pcm/opus frames| TTS -->|audio.track| WebRTC ==>|RTP Synth Speech| Client
